WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.243
Robots move things.

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:05.887
Businesses need the whole job to happen.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.261
In a warehouse,

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.067
a blocked aisle can hold up an

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:09.494
order.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:10.830
On a factory floor,

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.007
a missing parts tray can interrupt the

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:13.622
next step.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.113
And in a hospital's service corridor,

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.547
even a routine supply run needs the

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.075
right access.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.140
Witness Fleet is being built for the

00:00:22.205 --> 00:00:23.050
moments between,

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.340
"something went wrong," and,

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:26.807
"we know what happens next."

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.060
See what stopped the job.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:30.680
See what evidence is missing.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.767
Keep the next move on hold until

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.060
the required release,

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:36.020
and keep a record of the result.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:47.857
Not another robot.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.236
An accountability layer around the work.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.800
Today, that idea runs in a real

00:00:52.881 --> 00:00:53.361
simulation.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.929
Three robots inspect, recover, and deliver.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.268
The release in this demo is scripted.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.233
The delivery evidence is measured.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.218
The commercial starting point?

00:01:08.872 --> 00:01:10.107
One site.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.291
One recurring exception.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.645
Measure the investigation time and operator effort.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:17.080
Test the value before scaling.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:20.467
The proposed business: a site subscription,

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:21.603
with integration and support.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.098
Start with a focused evaluation.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.140
Grow only where the evidence supports it.

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.500
Witness Fleet.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.480
Every next move should have a reason.
